{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_36","type":"agent_message","text":"One modeling wrinkle is the projection relation for viscerofugal neurons: the obvious sensory-dendrite relation already in CL is the wrong one, and the synaptic-output relation is documented but not currently used in this file. I’m avoiding speculative axioms there unless I can anchor them to existing CL usage; the rest of the requested structure can be modeled cleanly with existing genus, soma-location, and neurotransmitter/function patterns."}}
